---
// Ill05LookThrough.astro
// Visual brief: The Fund Becomes Invisible — Direct Investment vs Category I/II AIF Look Through
---

<div class="my-10 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900/90 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm not-prose font-sans w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  <div class="px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 bg-slate-100/60 dark:bg-navy-950/60 flex items-center justify-between">
    <div>
      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold">Editorial Visual 05</div>
      <h3 class="text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-semibold m-0">Pass-Through: The Legal Act of Disappearance</h3>
    </div>
    <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 rounded border border-emerald-500/20 font-medium">Section 224</span>
  </div>

  <div class="p-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <!-- Left Panel: Direct Investment -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Model A</span>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-0.5 mb-4">Direct Investment</h4>

        <div class="w-full max-w-[200px] space-y-2">
          <div class="py-2 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-navy-900 rounded font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800">
            YOU
          </div>
          <div class="text-slate-400 text-xs">↓</div>
          <div class="py-2 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-navy-900 rounded font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800">
            SHARE / BOND
          </div>
          <div class="text-slate-400 text-xs">↓</div>
          <div class="py-2 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-navy-900 rounded font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800">
            CAPITAL GAIN
          </div>
          <div class="text-slate-400 text-xs">↓</div>
          <div class="py-2 bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 rounded font-mono text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-800">
            TAX (Direct)
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Panel: Category I/II AIF -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-800/60 flex flex-col items-center text-center relative overflow-hidden">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">Model B</span>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-0.5 mb-4">Category I / II AIF</h4>

        <div class="w-full max-w-[200px] space-y-2 relative z-10">
          <div class="py-2 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-navy-900 rounded font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800">
            YOU
          </div>
          <div class="text-emerald-500 text-xs">↓</div>
          <div class="py-2 bg-emerald-50/80 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 rounded font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-dashed border-emerald-400 dark:border-emerald-700 relative">
            <span class="opacity-40">AIF WRAPPER</span>
            <span class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 bg-white/70 dark:bg-navy-900/80 rounded">
              LOOK THROUGH
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-emerald-500 text-xs">↓</div>
          <div class="py-2 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-navy-900 rounded font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800">
            SHARE / BOND
          </div>
          <div class="text-emerald-500 text-xs">↓</div>
          <div class="py-2 bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 rounded font-mono text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-800">
            TAX (Pass-Through)
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="px-6 py-3 bg-slate-100/50 dark:bg-navy-950/40 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 text-center">
    <p class="text-xs italic text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 m-0">Pass-through taxation is a legal act of disappearance. The fund remains operationally real; its existence is prevented from automatically altering the investor's tax character.</p>
  </div>
</div>
